---
title: The Blessing
type: prayer
citation: BCP 339
rite: I
---

[Priest] The peace of God, which passeth all understanding, keep your hearts and minds in the knowledge and love of God, and of his Son Jesus Christ our Lord; and the blessing of God Almighty, the Father, the Son, and the Holy Ghost, be amongst you, and remain with you always.
[People] **Amen.**
